335 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The qualitative results of the Segmentation model show that the U-Net model is able to accurately localize and segment breast lesions in most test images. Predicted masks closely match the ground-truth annotations in terms of shape and position, even for small or low-contrast lesions. Some minor discrepancies appear along lesion boundaries or in challenging cases with noisy backgrounds, which is expected in ultrasound imaging.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
